<title>ITALY: Ambroveneto in jt venture with Credit Agricole.</title>
<headline>Ambroveneto in jt venture with Credit Agricole.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Banco Ambrosiano Veneto said in a statement on Wednesday it has agreed to set up an Italian consumer credit venture with Credit Agricole and Banque Sofinco.</p>
<p>It said the venture would involve integrating their respective companies operating in the sector. These are Itafinco, 75 percent-owned by Ambroveneto and 25 percent by Credit Agricole, and Agos Service, which is wholly-owned by Banque Sofinco.</p>
</text>
